# Stock Code types list (Equipment / Consumable per Stock Code).
# HIDDEN FROM THE PUBLIC REPOSITORY FOR PRIVACY PURPOSES: it is the company's Stock Code catalogue.
# It stays in the working folder, and app.spec bundles it into the .exe when it is present.
# A fresh clone has no such file: the app then starts with an empty list (Settings says so).
ctr_tools/stockcode_types.json
